    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The figure shows a hemispherical bowl of radius 12 cm. If water is poured into the bowl to a depth of 6 cm, find the area of the water surface.",
    "question_zh": "圖中所示為一個半徑為 12 cm 的半球形碗。若將水注入碗中至 6 cm 的深度，求水面的面積。",
    "options": [
      "A. $36\\pi$ cm$^2$",
      "B. $72\\pi$ cm$^2$",
      "C. $108\\pi$ cm$^2$",
      "D. $144\\pi$ cm$^2$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let $r$ be the radius of the water surface.",
      "The distance from the center of the sphere to the water surface is $12 - 6 = 6$ cm.",
      "By Pythagoras' theorem, $r^2 + 6^2 = 12^2$.",
      "$r^2 = 144 - 36 = 108$.",
      "Area of water surface $= \\pi r^2 = 108\\pi$ cm$^2$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設 $r$ 為水面的半徑。",
      "球心到水面的距離為 $12 - 6 = 6$ cm。",
      "根據畢氏定理，$r^2 + 6^2 = 12^2$。",
      "$r^2 = 144 - 36 = 108$。",
      "水面面積 $= \\pi r^2 = 108\\pi$ cm$^2$。"
    ],
