    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The table below shows the distribution of scores of a group of students in a test.\n\n[HTML]<div style=\"width: 100%; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 10px;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 320px; background: white; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);\"><thead><tr style=\"background: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;\"><th style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: center; color: #475569; font-weight: 800; border-right: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Statistic</th><th style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: center; color: #475569; font-weight: 800;\">Score</th></tr></thead><tbody style=\"color: #334155;\"><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">Minimum</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">20</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fff;\"><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">Lower Quartile (Q1)</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">40</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fff;\"><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">Median</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">55</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fff;\"><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">Upper Quartile (Q3)</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">80</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">Maximum</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">85</td></tr></tbody></table></div>[/HTML]",
    "question_zh": "下表顯示一組學生的測驗分數分佈。\n\n[HTML]<div style=\"width: 100%; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 10px;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 320px; background: white; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);\"><thead><tr style=\"background: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;\"><th style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: center; color: #475569; font-weight: 800; border-right: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">統計量</th><th style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: center; color: #475569; font-weight: 800;\">分數</th></tr></thead><tbody style=\"color: #334155;\"><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">最小值</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">20</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fff;\"><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">下四分位數 (Q1)</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">40</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fff;\"><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">中位數</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">55</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fff;\"><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">上四分位數 (Q3)</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">80</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; border-right: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fafafa;\">最大值</td><td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">85</td></tr></tbody></table></div>[/HTML]\n\n求該分佈的四分位位距。",
    "options": [
