    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "It is given that $y \\propto x^3$. If $x_1, x_2, x_3, \\dots$ is a geometric progression with common ratio $k$, then $y_1, y_2, y_3, \\dots$ is",
    "question_zh": "已知 $y \\propto x^3$。若 $x_1, x_2, x_3, \\dots$ 為一個公比為 $k$ 的等比數列，則 $y_1, y_2, y_3, \\dots$ 為",
    "options": [
      "A. a geometric progression with common ratio $k$.",
      "B. a geometric progression with common ratio $k^3$.",
      "C. an arithmetic progression with common difference $3k$.",
      "D. an arithmetic progression with common difference $k^3$."
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "$y = Cx^3$ for some constant $C$.",
      "$x_n = x_1 k^{n-1}$.",
      "$y_n = C (x_1 k^{n-1})^3 = (C x_1^3) (k^3)^{n-1}$.",
      "This is a geometric progression with first term $y_1 = C x_1^3$ and common ratio $k^3$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "$y = Cx^3$ (其中 $C$ 為常數)。",
      "$x_n = x_1 k^{n-1}$。",
      "$y_n = C (x_1 k^{n-1})^3 = (C x_1^3) (k^3)^{n-1}$。",
      "這是一個首項為 $y_1$，公比為 $k^3$ 的等比數列。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_178",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
