  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_180",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_mensuration",
      "math_trig_applications"
    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "A right circular cone has a semi-vertical angle $\\theta$. If the radius of the base is $r$ and the curved surface area is twice the base area, find $\\theta$.",
    "question_zh": "一個直立圓錐的半頂角為 $\\theta$。若底半徑為 $r$ 且側面積為底面積的兩倍，求 $\\theta$。",
    "options": [
      "A. $30^\\circ$",
      "B. $45^\\circ$",
      "C. $60^\\circ$",
      "D. $75^\\circ$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Base area $= \\pi r^2$.",
      "Curved surface area $= \\pi r l$, where $l$ is the slant height.",
      "Given $\\pi r l = 2 (\\pi r^2) \\Rightarrow l = 2r$.",
      "In the right triangle formed by $r, h, l$, $\\sin \\theta = r/l$.",
      "$\\sin \\theta = r/(2r) = 1/2$.",
      "$\\theta = 30^\\circ$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "底面積 $= \\pi r^2$。",
      "側面積 $= \\pi r l$，其中 $l$ 為母線（斜高）。",
      "已知 $\\pi r l = 2\\pi r^2 \\Rightarrow l = 2r$。",
      "在直角三角形中，$\\sin \\theta = r/l$。",
